 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 13.5,
   "end": 17.5,
   "text": "Someday you'll come back here"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.3,
   "end": 23.0,
   "text": "And you'll open up your arms"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.3,
   "end": 31.3,
   "text": "And you'll laugh and say I knew it wouldn't take you long"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.6,
   "end": 35.0,
   "text": "To realize I was gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.3,
   "end": 41.5,
   "text": "And it's only been three years"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.3,
   "end": 47.0,
   "text": "But to me it's been so long"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.0,
   "end": 53.3,
   "text": "And I remember it like yesterday"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.5,
   "end": 59.0,
   "text": "Oh you could say I've been holding on"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.8,
   "end": 65.0,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.3,
   "end": 68.0,
   "text": "For you to make it right"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.0,
   "end": 71.0,
   "text": "But the time has come and gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.8,
   "end": 77.0,
   "text": "And it's faded and lost all its light"
  },
  {
   "start": 77.2,
   "end": 80.0,
   "text": "A star that shines so bright"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.0,
   "end": 83.0,
   "text": "Falls from the sky"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.3,
   "end": 88.3,
   "text": "Don't make a wish that won't come true"
  },
  {
   "start": 88.8,
   "end": 95.0,
   "text": "And I learned that from you such a long time ago"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.3,
   "end": 100.3,
   "text": "When you left you said you had to find"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.8,
   "end": 103.5,
   "text": "A better way of life"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.8,
   "end": 106.8,
   "text": "This one just wouldn't do"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.8,
   "end": 113.0,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.3,
   "end": 116.0,
   "text": "For you to take your time"
  },
  {
   "start": 116.3,
   "end": 119.5,
   "text": "To find your place"
  },
  {
   "start": 120.3,
   "end": 124.0,
   "text": "But I learned that this world still turns without you"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.0,
   "end": 125.6,
   "text": "And you were just a phase"
  },
  {
   "start": 125.6,
   "end": 128.0,
   "text": "And I learned without you here"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.2,
   "end": 131.0,
   "text": "I was happier alone"
  },
  {
   "start": 131.2,
   "end": 134.5,
   "text": "Than I ever would have known"
  },
  {
   "start": 156.0,
   "end": 160.0,
   "text": "And I'm waiting, I'm waiting"
  },
  {
   "start": 162.0,
   "end": 168.5,
   "text": "And I'm waiting, I'm waiting, I'm waiting"
  },
  {
   "start": 168.5,
   "end": 173.0,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 173.3,
   "end": 176.0,
   "text": "For you to take your time"
  },
  {
   "start": 176.0,
   "end": 179.5,
   "text": "But the time has come and gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 179.8,
   "end": 185.0,
   "text": "And it's faded and lost all its light"
  },
  {
   "start": 185.2,
   "end": 188.0,
   "text": "A star that shines so bright"
  },
  {
   "start": 188.0,
   "end": 191.0,
   "text": "Falls from the sky"
  },
  {
   "start": 191.0,
   "end": 196.0,
   "text": "On this cold December night"
